      "id": "birthday_letter_content",
      "label": "Birthday Letter Text",
      "default": "<p>Happy Birthday to the most special person in my universe. From the girl who was once afraid to trust love, to the woman who now chooses you without hesitation every single day—thank you for being my home, my comfort, and my peace.</p><p>May this year bring you as much happiness, warmth, and quiet strength as you have given me since the moment our hearts first spoke in silence. No matter where life takes us, remember: my favourite future will always have you in it.</p><p>With all my love, forever and always. ❤️</p>"
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "memory_photo",
      "name": "Memory Photo",
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "image_picker",
          "id": "image",
          "label": "Memory Photograph"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "caption",
          "label": "Caption",
          "default": "A quiet moment together"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "date",
          "label": "Date or Location",
          "default": "October 2026"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Birthday Love Story",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "memory_photo",
          "settings": {
            "caption": "Where it all felt like home",
            "date": "Our First Walk"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "memory_photo",
          "settings": {
            "caption": "The quiet smile I never forget",
            "date": "Unspoken Magic"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "memory_photo",
          "settings": {
            "caption": "Holding hands, holding promises",
            "date": "Hand in Hand"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "memory_photo",
          "settings": {
